_kb/
KB_*.md

# --- Agents/ (SBV Agent Fleet) -----------------------------------------
# This folder handles real client financial data. Nothing containing a real
# client's figures, name, or business details may be tracked. Keep the
# folder skeletons via .gitkeep; ignore everything placed inside them.

# Operator-dropped source files and agent-generated outputs — always real
# client data once an engagement runs.
Agents/**/inputs/*
!Agents/**/inputs/.gitkeep
Agents/**/outputs/*
!Agents/**/outputs/.gitkeep

# Golden examples need manual sanitization before they're safe to track.
# This is a default-safe gate, not an automatic exclude-forever — once a
# specific file is sanitized it can be force-added deliberately.
Agents/**/02-golden-examples/*
!Agents/**/02-golden-examples/.gitkeep

# Known naming deviation (see Agents/CLAUDE.md "Five-file structure"): these
# three agents use a *file* named 02-golden-example(s).md instead of a
# 02-golden-examples/ folder, so the wildcard rule above doesn't reach them.
# Each one was confirmed during inventory to contain real client data
# (real names and/or real financial figures) and must stay untracked until
# individually sanitized.
Agents/01-Foundation/SBV-Intake/02-golden-example.md
Agents/01-Foundation/SBV-Observations/02-golden-examples.md
Agents/02-Assembly/SBV-VB-Summary/02-golden-examples.md

# Shared source docs, per-engagement working folders, final client
# deliverables, and internal analysis logs — all real client content.
Agents/ExampleDocuments/
Agents/Engagements/
Agents/Deliverables/
Agents/_session-logs/

# Flagged in the June 2026 pre-commit audit: real client/business names or
# real financial figures embedded directly in otherwise-trackable files, or
# unverified content. Excluded pending a manual redaction pass.
Agents/Combined Documents.pdf
Agents/Combined Documents 2.pdf
Agents/Bootcamp/*.mp4
Agents/00-chief-of-staff/chief-of-staff.md
Agents/00-chief-of-staff/agent-registry.md
Agents/02-Assembly/SBV-Earnings-Value/01-start-here.md
Agents/02-Assembly/SBV-Earnings-Value/03-process.md
Agents/02-Assembly/SBV-Earnings-Value/04-context.md
Agents/02-Assembly/SBV-Report-Narrative/01-start-here.md
Agents/02-Assembly/SBV-Report-Narrative/03-process.md
Agents/02-Assembly/SBV-Report-Narrative/04-context.md

# macOS clutter picked up while browsing these folders.
Agents/**/.DS_Store
